      "score": 125,
      "comments": 15,
      "author": "kevincox",
      "published": "2026-08-04T18:31:48Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Modern memory-safe languages like Rust and automated SAST tools mitigate fundamental vulnerabilities, but logic flaws still require rigorous threat modeling.",
        "Security failures increasingly originate from third-party supply chain dependencies and complex IAM permission misconfigurations across cloud environments.",
        "Implementing Zero Trust architecture and defense-in-depth ensures resilient isolation, prioritizing rapid detection and automated response when prevention fails."
      ]
    },
