      "published": "2026-08-05T13:58:53Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Positions Cloudflare Workers and Durable Objects as an OS-level runtime layer for orchestrating and sandboxing autonomous AI agents at the edge.",
        "Replaces traditional Kubernetes and VM infrastructure with serverless edge primitives, simplifying deployment, scaling, and state management for distributed workloads.",
        "Integrates network routing, persistent storage, and event-driven API orchestration into a single platform to streamline DevOps pipelines."
      ]
